{"id":"050c95095a2d9bab","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-tait-formula.md","title":"Tait 公式与文字","display":"df-tait-formula — Tait 公式与文字","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-tait-formula","aliases":["18-df-tait-formula","18-df-029"],"display":"df-tait-formula — Tait 公式与文字","depends_on":["[[18-df-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§4.3","source_pages":"53","source_pdf_pages":"63","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-tait-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-tait-formula</span><span>18-df-029</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tait-formula — Tait 公式与文字"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.3"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"53"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(S,\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>。下面的联结词和量词均为有限语法树的构造子，否定构造只允许作用于原子公式。</p>\n<p>本节引入集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\)</span> 及近似族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\cup\\{\\neg A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\cup\\{\\neg A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\\\\nT_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{(A\\land B),(A\\lor B)\\mid A,B\\in T_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A,\\exists x A\\mid A\\in T_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}T_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\\\\nT_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{(A\\land B),(A\\lor B)\\mid A,B\\in T_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A,\\exists x A\\mid A\\in T_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}T_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 §4.3 正联结词语法的一阶构造树重建。原书还容许关系变量；本节点沿用本地签名 S 的一阶接口，不把该接口声称为原书完整二阶语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-formula]] 的 $S,\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S$。下面的联结词和量词均为有限语法树的构造子，否定构造只允许作用于原子公式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\cup\\{\\neg A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Lit}_S,\\\\\nT_{n+1}&\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{(A\\land B),(A\\lor B)\\mid A,B\\in T_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x A,\\exists x A\\mid A\\in T_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}T_n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1334,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-tait-formula]]"},{"id":"4749ed189a9a04e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，$F,G\\in\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$，均取自 [[18-df-tait-formula]]。定义 $\\sim:\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S\\to\\mathrm{TaitFml}_S$。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-tait-formula]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-tait-formula]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-tait-formula|18-df-tait-formula]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-tait-formula|18-df-tait-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c383b33"]}